# Per-Dockerfile build-context excludes for docker/fastapi.Dockerfile
# (BuildKit: a `<Dockerfile-name>.dockerignore` next to the Dockerfile
# REPLACES the context root's .dockerignore for this build, so this file
# must be complete — it cannot rely on src/.dockerignore as a base).
#
# Context root is ./src (see docker-compose.yml + .github/workflows/ci.yml).
# The fastapi image needs only fastapi/ + georag_object_storage/; the
# sibling dagster/ tree is dead weight in this build's context.

dagster/

**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.venv
fastapi/.venv/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/htmlcov
**/dist
**/*.egg-info
**/.claude
**/tests/fixtures

# fastapi-specific — see src/.dockerignore for the history of each entry.
fastapi/C:
fastapi/models/
fastapi/data/
fastapi/bench_results/
fastapi/retrieval_threshold_sweep.csv
fastapi/run_eval*.py
